{"id":"00034","root":"uni00034_1","name":{"ja":"グラン","en":"Gran"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"グラン","en":"Gran"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":33,"profile":{"ja":"魔族の一種で無機物と有機物の肉体を持つゴーレムと呼ばれる種族の女戦士。グランはゴーレムの中でも“ストーン・ゴーレム”と呼ばれ岩石の肉体を持つのが特徴。相棒で幼馴染の黄泉秋津とともにある目的を果たすため魔界や人間界を旅している。無口。喋らざること岩のごとし。しかし、唯一、黄泉とは会話が成立する。ただし、他人からその会話は黄泉が一方的に喋ってるように見える。黄泉には友達以上の想いを寄せているが、本人は恋愛感情とは気づいていない。レズというよりも黄泉がむちゃくちゃ好き。故に黄泉に仇なすものはすべて粉砕する。青肌の部分は張りのある人間と同じような有機物による肉体で、手足はストーン・ゴーレム族特有の頑丈な岩に覆われている。岩の部分は再生能力が高く、砕け散っても数日で元通りになる。身体のあちこちに散見される水晶部分はいわば人間の心臓にあたり生命の源である。この水晶部分は非常に硬度が高く、高値で取引されるため狙われる事もしばしば。無論、ゴーレムたちは一騎当千の戦闘力を有しているので簡単に狩られる事はない。","en":"(Gran, she/her) She is a female warrior of a demon race known as golems—beings that possess both inorganic and organic bodies. Gran belongs to the \"Stone Golem\" subtype, characterized by a rocky physique. Together with her childhood friend Yomi Akitsu, she travels across the Demon Realm and Human Realm to fulfill a certain goal. She is taciturn, as silent as a stone, though she can converse with Yomi; to outsiders, their dialogue appears one-sided, as if Yomi is doing all the talking. Gran harbors feelings for Yomi that go beyond friendship, though she doesn't recognize them as romantic—she simply loves Yomi intensely and will crush anyone who harms her. Her blue-toned flesh is a supple organic tissue akin to human skin, while her limbs are covered in the sturdy rock typical of stone golems. The rocky parts regenerate quickly, restoring themselves within days after being shattered. Crystalline sections scattered across her body function like a human heart, the source of her life; these crystals are extremely hard and valuable, making them frequent targets. Of course, golems possess combat power capable of taking on a thousand foes, so they are not easily hunted."},"illustrator":"みこやん","voiceActor":"佐倉もも花","forms":[{"id":"uni00034_1","rarity":2,"rarity